---
description: Follow the Elevate style guide for any UI change
globs: src/**/*.tsx, src/**/*.ts, src/app/globals.css
alwaysApply: false
---

Any change that touches what users see follows `STYLE_GUIDE.md`. Read it before writing UI code.

In short: values come from `src/components/ui/theme/tokens.ts`; MUI owns components and text (`<Typography variant="pageTitle | cardTitle | kpi | body | secondary | label">`); Tailwind is layout only; violet `primary` is for actions, slate `secondary` for navigation and settings; no raw colors, arbitrary values or Tailwind type and palette classes (lint rejects them).

Full rule: "UI and styling (mandatory)" in `AGENTS.md`.
